# os-rice/windows.map — logical package name -> real id per manager.
# Windows equivalent of lib/pkgmap/*.map, collapsed into one file because
# there's one OS here, not five package managers each needing their own
# map: the "column" that varies per-distro on Linux is a `mgr:id` token on
# the RHS instead. Ported from the now-retired windows-rice/windows.map
# (see PLAN_UNIVERSAL.md decision 8) — lib/winpkg.c reads this file.
#
# Format: name = mgr:id [mgr:id ...]   (any subset of scoop/choco/winget; a
# manager with no token for this name is skipped for it — same "no entry =
# not available that way" rule as pkgmap). osr_winpkg_install (lib/winpkg.c)
# tries them in the scoop -> choco -> winget preference order, using whichever
# manager is actually installed.

pwsh       = scoop:pwsh choco:powershell-core winget:Microsoft.PowerShell
wezterm    = scoop:wezterm choco:wezterm winget:wez.wezterm
oh-my-posh = scoop:oh-my-posh choco:oh-my-posh winget:JanDeDobbeleer.OhMyPosh
starship   = scoop:starship choco:starship winget:Starship.Starship
fastfetch  = scoop:fastfetch choco:fastfetch winget:Fastfetch-cli.Fastfetch
